[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2798522140","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/105248#issuecomment-2798522140","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105248","id":2798522140,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6mzg8c","user":{"login":"clayjohn","id":16521339,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NTIxMzM5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16521339?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn","html_url":"https://github.com/clayjohn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-12T06:23:31Z","updated_at":"2025-04-12T06:38:16Z","body":"Testing locally I can confirm the performance regression. \n\n~Looking at the monitors I can see that in 4.3 this scene results in 12 draw calls while in 4.4 it results in 15,000.~\n\n~The batching issue is from dev1~ _edit: The monitors were wrong before dev1 https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/95640_\n\nThe performance change is from dev 6 _edit: Most likely caused by https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/90644_","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2798522140/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2819146943","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/105248#issuecomment-2819146943","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105248","id":2819146943,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6oCMS_","user":{"login":"Kabraxis9","id":55838372,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU1ODM4Mzcy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/55838372?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kabraxis9","html_url":"https://github.com/Kabraxis9","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kabraxis9/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kabraxis9/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kabraxis9/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kabraxis9/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kabraxis9/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kabraxis9/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kabraxis9/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kabraxis9/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kabraxis9/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-21T18:03:40Z","updated_at":"2025-04-22T18:07:22Z","body":"I started getting immediate crashes enabling \"Visible Collision Shapes\" either using Jolt or the Standard physics.\nAfter quite some trial and error I have concluded a certain amount of CSGBoxes3D crash the Godot application for me when running a project.\nI decided to create a brand-new project. I added a camera, added 100 CSGBoxes, enabled collision on them, enabled Visible Collision Shapes debug option... and immediate screen freeze on running the test level.\n\nThe 64th (default 1x1x1) CSGBox3D crashes my projects. Same for CSGCombiners (as long as they have collision enabled and at least one CSGBox3D). In short: 64 times the flag \"collision enabled\" is too much.\nCan be a combination of 50 CSGCombiners with 100 CSGBoxes in them each - those don't matter anymore - and 13 solo CSGBoxes3D, no problem. I add one more, 64 total, and I can't make the collision shapes visible anymore. ","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2819146943/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2974551238","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/105248#issuecomment-2974551238","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105248","id":2974551238,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6xTAzG","user":{"login":"mihe","id":4884246,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ4ODQyNDY=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4884246?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe","html_url":"https://github.com/mihe","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-15T18:41:54Z","updated_at":"2025-06-15T18:41:54Z","body":"I took a closer look at this, and I can confirm that this is indeed caused by #90644.\n\nMore specifically, it seems a big part of it stem from the fact that `Shape3D::collision_material` is being recreated for every single `Shape3D`, as opposed to being shared across multiple instances, like it was before when it relied on the shared `SceneTree::collision_material`.\n\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/019ab8745fb74c2f0e479c83fa1f029eee75ea2c/scene/resources/3d/shape_3d.h#L47\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/019ab8745fb74c2f0e479c83fa1f029eee75ea2c/scene/resources/3d/shape_3d.cpp#L147-L165\n\nI couldn't see a reason why this needs to be recreated all the time, so I tried adding `inline static` to the material declaration in `shape_3d.h`, just as a quick hack, and that indeed seems to resolve a big part of the regression (but not all of it).\n\nI also don't quite understand why the old `SceneTree::collision_material` was left intact to begin with. It would seem like part of the solution here is to simply replace `SceneTree::get_debug_collision_material` with what's in `Shape3D::get_debug_collision_material`, and then do whatever needs doing to make it work with `GridMap` (its only remaining user) and once again rely on this shared material instance.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2974551238/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":1},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3075436551","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/105248#issuecomment-3075436551","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105248","id":3075436551,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc63T3AH","user":{"login":"TokisanGames","id":632766,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYzMjc2Ng==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/632766?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokisanGames","html_url":"https://github.com/TokisanGames","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokisanGames/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokisanGames/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokisanGames/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokisanGames/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokisanGames/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokisanGames/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokisanGames/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokisanGames/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokisanGames/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-07-15T20:24:36Z","updated_at":"2025-07-15T20:24:36Z","body":"We just discovered that https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/90644 caused us a huge performance regression, lots of vram consumption, and crashes in Terrain3D. This was in a mode with only 3 heightmapshapes sized 1025, but it used 50% more vram. So I don't know why only 3 materials would be the problem for us.\n\n<img width=\"265\" height=\"121\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/d1cf09db-63ac-4244-bb82-1be72bea8b1c\" />\n\n<img width=\"273\" height=\"121\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/8b5e1c38-6765-43df-acc9-a1be6511110b\" />\n\nAnyway, we solved it by disabling debug fill, which defaults to on (and should). But we don't need it for terrain.\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3075436551/reactions","total_count":3,"+1":3,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3139164101","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/105248#issuecomment-3139164101","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105248","id":3139164101,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc67G9fF","user":{"login":"diegopau","id":315149,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMxNTE0OQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/315149?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/diegopau","html_url":"https://github.com/diegopau","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/diegopau/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/diegopau/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/diegopau/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/diegopau/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/diegopau/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/diegopau/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/diegopau/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/diegopau/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/diegopau/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-07-31T09:14:17Z","updated_at":"2025-07-31T09:14:17Z","body":"Hi, I am posting this in both this issue and also #108435 since both affected the same MRP and since both issues have been merged into the same new Godot version (beta 4) it is not straight forward to know exactly how much each of them contributed to the fix.\n\nFirst of all thank you for solving this issue!!\n\nI don't want to be picky but since I have been following this sort of performance regression since Godot 4.3 I thought I would leave here my tests now after the fix. Maybe some performance lost since 4.3 is acceptable for this specific scenarios since many things were added to the engine since then and this trade off is acceptable, but I just wanted to let you know that there seems to still be a significant difference from what 4.3 was able to do and keep in mind that the more collisions are visible the more the performance difference would probably since it seems to be more about how Godot handles very large number of visible collisions and the performance quickly degrades after reaching a high number.\n\nThis is the MRP I used for my tests. You just need to download them (one is for Godot 4.3 and the other for any version of Godot 4.5 but it is just the same scene), enable the Visible Collision Shapes toggle and hit the Run Project button. To make things equal in Godot 4.5 I disabled the \"Embed Game\" option for running the project.\n[collisions-MRP-1-Godot4.3.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/21526427/collisions-MRP-1-Godot4.3.zip)\n[collisions-MRP-1-Godot4.5.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/21526428/collisions-MRP-1-Godot4.5.zip)\n\nResults:\nThis shows the improvement since I reported #108435 which was a big regression.\n<img width=\"2556\" height=\"1546\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/366d1b23-4c13-45bd-84d2-21808a72bb65\" />\n\nThis shows the improvement between 4.5.dev4 (before regression #108435) and the latest beta:\n<img width=\"2556\" height=\"1517\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/d354ce3c-e9a4-4c05-abc3-e8e8946488dd\" />\n\nFinally here I compare 4.3 with the latest beta, 4.3 still runs faster, around a 20% faster:\n<img width=\"2556\" height=\"1525\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/b07c5b23-1ffa-478f-b890-b26b275a50b1\" />\n\nThis is a small difference now, but still significant, so I hope my report is useful.\nThanks again.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3139164101/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3140152635","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/105248#issuecomment-3140152635","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/